<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Coverage Matrix</title>
<style>
    body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333333;
        margin: 40px;
    }
    h1 {
        color: #1a5276;
        border-bottom: 2.5px solid #1a5276;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: 24pt;
        margin-top: 20px;
    }
    h2 {
        color: #2980b9;
        margin-top: 35px;
        border-bottom: 1.5px solid #ddd;
        padding-bottom: 5px;
        font-size: 18pt;
    }
    h3 {
        color: #2e86c1;
        font-size: 14pt;
        margin-top: 25px;
    }
    table {
        border-collapse: collapse;
        width: 100%;
        margin: 25px 0;
        font-size: 11pt;
    }
    th, td {
        border: 1px solid #cccccc;
        text-align: left;
        padding: 10px;
    }
    th {
        background-color: #f2f4f4;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #1a5276;
    }
    tr:nth-child(even) {
        background-color: #f8f9f9;
    }
    code {
        font-family: Consolas, Monaco, Courier, monospace;
        background-color: #f4f6f7;
        color: #c0392b;
        padding: 2px 5px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        font-size: 10pt;
    }
    pre {
        background-color: #f4f6f7;
        padding: 15px;
        border: 1px solid #d5dbdb;
        border-radius: 5px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin: 20px 0;
    }
    pre code {
        color: #333333;
        background-color: transparent;
        padding: 0;
    }
    blockquote {
        border-left: 5px solid #3498db;
        background-color: #ebf5fb;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        color: #2c3e50;
        font-style: italic;
    }
    ul, ol {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        padding-left: 30px;
    }
    li {
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    hr {
        border: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #d5dbdb;
        margin: 30px 0;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Thesis Methodology: Acoustic Dataset Coverage Matrix</h1>
<p>This matrix maps all 31 acoustic classes and sub-classes to their respective download sources. It proves how your dataset achieves 100% coverage using the listed open-source databases and custom YouTube scraping.</p>
<hr />
<h2>1. Threat / Illegal Activity Coverage</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: left;">Class / Sub-Class</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">Sourced From</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">Specific File / Search Tag to Use</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Chainsaw (Gasoline)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSC22, ESC-50, Zenodo</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Folder: <code>chainsaw</code> / Tag: <code>chainsaw</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Chainsaw (Electric)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, YouTube</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Search: "electric chainsaw sound", "battery chainsaw"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Axe (Hardwood/Metallic ring)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSC22, FSD50K</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>axe</code>, <code>wood chopping</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Axe (Softwood/Wet thud)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, Custom recording</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>chopping wood</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Machete (Clearing brush/bamboo)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, YouTube</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Search: "clearing brush machete", "bamboo cutting"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Handsaw (Manual)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSC22, FSD50K</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>handsaw</code>, <code>sawing wood</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Tree Cracking &amp; Falling</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSC22, FSD50K</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>tree falling</code>, <code>wood cracking</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Heavy Machinery</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, ESC-50</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>engine</code>, <code>tractor</code>, <code>bulldozer</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Gunshot (Supersonic Rifle)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Mendeley Gunshot, FSD50K</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Category: <code>Rifle</code>, <code>supersonic crack</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Gunshot (Subsonic Pistol)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Mendeley Gunshot, ESC-50</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Category: <code>Pistol</code> / Folder: <code>gunshot</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Gunshot (Shotgun)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Mendeley Gunshot, ESC-50</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Category: <code>Shotgun</code> / Folder: <code>gunshot</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Gunshot (Air Rifle)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, YouTube</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Search: "air rifle shooting", "pellet gun pop"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Vehicle Engine (Truck/SUV)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSC22, FSD50K</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>diesel engine</code>, <code>suv engine</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Motorcycle / Dirt Bike</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, ESC-50</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>motorcycle</code>, <code>dirt bike</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Human Speech / Voices</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, AudioSet</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>speech</code>, <code>conversation</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Shouting / Screaming</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, ESC-50</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>screaming</code>, <code>shouting</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Footsteps (Dry Leaves)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">ESC-50, FSD50K</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Folder: <code>footsteps</code> / Search: "footsteps dry leaves"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Walkie-Talkie (Static/Beeps)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, YouTube</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Search: "walkie talkie static", "VHF squelch"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Metal Clinking (Traps/Snares)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, YouTube</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Search: "setting steel trap", "metal cage door click"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Shoveling / Digging</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>digging</code>, <code>shoveling</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Hunting Dog (Bark/Howl)</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">ESC-50</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Folder: <code>dog</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Drone Propeller Hum</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, YouTube</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Tag: <code>drone</code>, <code>quadcopter</code> / Search: "drone flying close"</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Explosive Blast</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">FSD50K, ESC-50</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Folder: <code>explosion</code> / Tag: <code>explosion</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><strong>Campfire Crackle</strong></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">ESC-50</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">Folder: <code>crackling_fire</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
<h2>2. Natural Background &amp; Fauna Coverage (Filters)</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: left;">Class / Sub-Class</th>
